@startuml
!include common-style.puml

title Container Diagram\n4N Clinic Management System

top to bottom direction

actor "Clinic Staff\n(Admin / Receptionist / Doctor\nCashier / Manager / Nurse / Lab / Pharmacist)" as Staff #E0F2FE

rectangle "Web Browser\nChrome / Edge" as Browser #F8FAFC

rectangle "4N Clinic Management System" as Boundary #FAFAFA {

  rectangle "Frontend SPA\n--\nReact 18 + Vite + TypeScript\nTailwind CSS + shadcn/ui\nTanStack Query + Zustand\nRole-based UI / Protected routes" as FE #DBEAFE

  rectangle "Backend REST API\n--\nNestJS + TypeScript\nJWT Guard + Roles Guard\n92 endpoints / api/v1\nSwagger at /api/docs" as BE #CCFBF1

  database "PostgreSQL 15\n--\nlocalhost:5432\n37 models / 12 enums\n3 migrations" as DB #F3E8FF

  rectangle "Prisma ORM\n--\nSchema-first\nMigrations\nTyped client" as Prisma #FEF9C3

}

Staff --> Browser : uses
Browser --> FE : loads SPA via HTTP :5173
FE --> BE : HTTPS JSON REST\nAuthorization: Bearer <token>
BE --> Prisma : PrismaService calls
Prisma --> DB : SQL queries

note right of BE
All routes require JWT.
Role-based access enforced
per controller method via
@Roles() decorator.
end note

@enduml
